{'symbol': 'SPG', 'date': '2023-03-01 17:10:00', 'title': 'SIMON PROPERTY GROUP SELLS $1.3 BILLION OF SENIOR NOTES', 'text': 'INDIANAPOLIS , MARCH 1, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SIMON®, A REAL ESTATE INVESTMENT TRUST ENGAGED IN THE OWNERSHIP OF PREMIER SHOPPING, DINING, ENTERTAINMENT AND MIXED-USE DESTINATIONS, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS MAJORITY-OWNED OPERATING PARTNERSHIP SUBSIDIARY, SIMON PROPERTY GROUP, L.P. (THE "OPERATING PARTNERSHIP"), HAS AGREED TO SELL: $650 MILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF ITS 5.500% NOTES DUE 2033, AND $650 MILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF ITS 5.850% NOTES DUE 2053.'}